<title>JORDAN: Jordan dinar overnight rate drops to 8.57 pct.</title>
<headline>Jordan dinar overnight rate drops to 8.57 pct.</headline>
<dateline>AMMAN 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The weighted average overnight interbank rate on the Jordanian dinar fell to 8.57 percent on Monday from 8.95 percent on Sunday, the Central Bank said.</p>
<p>It said six banks traded on the market in 13 reported transactions with a total value of 16.1 million dinars ($23 million).</p>
<p>$1 = 0.7080 dinar</p>
<p>-- Amman newsroom +962 6 623 776</p>
